---
import '../styles/global.css';
import { getBuildMeta } from '../lib/build-meta';
import { formatDateTime } from '../lib/format';

interface Props {
  title?: string;
}
const { title } = Astro.props;
const meta = getBuildMeta();
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const pageTitle = title ? `${title}｜AI Trend Radar` : 'AI Trend Radar';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>{pageTitle}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="site">
        <h1><a href={base}>AI Trend Radar</a></h1>
        <p>模型、Coding Agent 與訂閱政策的查核後變化</p>
      </header>
      <main>
        <slot />
      </main>
      <footer class="site" id="build-meta" data-site-built-at={meta.site_built_at}>
        <p>site_built_at：台北時間 {formatDateTime(new Date(meta.site_built_at))}</p>
        {meta.merged_at && <p>合併時間：台北時間 {formatDateTime(new Date(meta.merged_at))}</p>}
        <p>
          commit：
          {meta.commit
            ? meta.commit_url
              ? <a href={meta.commit_url}><code>{meta.commit.slice(0, 7)}</code></a>
              : <code>{meta.commit.slice(0, 7)}</code>
            : <span>本機建置（非正式部署）</span>}
        </p>
        {meta.pr_url && <p>來源 PR：<a href={meta.pr_url}>{meta.pr_url.replace('https://github.com/', '')}</a></p>}
        <p>本站只顯示合併至 main 並成功部署的內容；誰核准了什麼，以 GitHub PR 紀錄為準。</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
